- **7:00-7:20 (green fan room)** Proog crouches, Emo with arms crossed, then a wide where they stand apart. 7:08-7:20 is about 12 s of one wide shot, and I could see in 0.5 s steps that it barely moves: Emo is almost frozen, Proog's arms shift a little. It reads as posed, not acted. The line "Emo." (7:09-7:10) is the shouted word at the cue; I heard "Emo." and the reply "Yeah?" so the single words read. The next lines ("why can't you see the beauty of this place") are clear.
